                {
                  "type": "line",
                  "character_uuid": "e09f5cd2-3657-4240-b080-f21c190842ae",
                  "text": "Then say it softer next time."
                },
                {
                  "type": "hide_character",
                  "character_uuid": "e09f5cd2-3657-4240-b080-f21c190842ae"
                },
                {
                  "type": "narration",
                  "text": "The envelope catches against the sugar caddy before Deke covers it with his hand. He tucks a tight fold of cash under Nina's napkin."
