                  "character_expression": "surprised",
                  "screen_position": "center"
                },
                {
                  "type": "line",
                  "character_uuid": "e09f5cd2-3657-4240-b080-f21c190842ae",
                  "text": "Hell. New girl talks like she's got miles on her."
                },
                {
                  "type": "hide_character",
                  "character_uuid": "e09f5cd2-3657-4240-b080-f21c190842ae"
                },
                {
                  "type": "narration",
                  "text": "Nina lets the envelope drift across the table with a fingertip. Deke answers with a weighted bundle nudged against her cup."
